"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nKKXOJjWfcue29pzYcZfUjCGLnR.jpg\"},{\"id\":1119000,\"name\":\"Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy\",\"character\":\"Narrator (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cKhKa6bILO5bp9Miwd5HXQVUEUz.jpg\"},{\"id\":86837,\"name\":\"Yuri Belov\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8wgzKHZg8o2Jp2LQzzjAnPLOxN5.jpg\"},{\"id\":5068109,\"name\":\"Valeriy Ponarin\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2087110,\"name\":\"Leonid Trutnev\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ldP9SXboV3fQkQRDKvK7uxANQgJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":6055145,\"name\":\"Sergey Bardygin\",\"character\":\"Bogatyr\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3527664,\"name\":\"Viktor Sidorov\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zzZcMU7MRHoDtiYeSojBMn525aW.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaet1xQ2nxrG0V1Ep9T20ZMNEIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":109445,\"title\":\"Frozen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/itAKcobTYGpYT8Phwjd8c9hleTo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rj58WQ9ImI0mYDptXdM7euX1Wjt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young princess Anna of Arendelle dreams about finding true love at her sister Elsa’s coronation. Fate takes her on a dangerous journey in an attempt to end the eternal winter that has fallen over the kingdom. She's accompanied by ice delivery man Kristoff, his reindeer Sven, and snowman Olaf. On an adventure where she will find out what friendship, courage, family, and true love really means.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":321612,\"title\":\"Beauty and the Beast\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hKegSKIDep2ewJWPUQD7u0KqFIp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uU1Mt4JWhDvl4vKb3AfxNsorkoM.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A live-action adaptation of Disney's version of the classic tale of a cursed prince and a beautiful young woman who helps him break the spell.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":330457,\"title\":\"Frozen II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mINJaa34MtknCYl5AjtNJzWj8cD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AoSZyb37ljMAxw0RdeQEBHKtgcc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Elsa, Anna, Kristoff and Olaf head far into the forest to learn the truth about an ancient mystery of their kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":568124,\"title\":\"Encanto\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4j0PNHkMr5ax3IA8tjtxcmPU3QT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3G1Q5xF40HkUBJXxt2DQgQzKTp5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The tale of an extraordinary family, the Madrigals, who live hidden in the mountains of Colombia, in a magical house, in a vibrant town, in a wondrous, charmed place called an Encanto. The magic of the Encanto has blessed every child in the family—every child except one, Mirabel. But when she discovers that the magic surrounding the Encanto is in danger, Mirabel decides that she, the only ordinary Madrigal, might just be her exceptional family's last hope.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10198,\"title\":\"The Princess and the Frog\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yprv5PbnEksoVj2v6XEnDBg9joR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y5tad0a4yRbxYgOHGllEIEeCCKt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A waitress, desperate to fulfill her dreams as a restaurant owner, is set on a journey to turn a frog prince back into a human being, but she has to face the same problem after she kisses him.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":787699,\"title\":\"Wonka\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qhb1qOilapbapxWQn9jtRCMwXJF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uIk2g2bRkNwNywKZIhC5oIU94Kh.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Willy Wonka – chock-full of ideas and determined to change the world one delectable bite at a time – is proof that the best things in life begin with a dream, and if you’re lucky enough to meet Willy Wonka, anything is possible.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":447273,\"title\":\"Snow White\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oLxWocqheC8XbXbxqJ3x422j9PW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tyfO9jHgkhypUFizRVYD0bytPjP.jpg\",\"rating\":4.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the benevolent King's disappearance, the Evil Queen dominated the once fair land with a cruel streak. Princess Snow White flees the castle when the Queen, in her jealousy over Snow White's inner beauty, tries to kill her. Deep into the dark woods, she stumbles upon seven magical dwarves and a young bandit named Jonathan. Together, they strive to survive the Queen's relentless pursuit and aspire to take back the kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1318621,\"title\":\"Descendants: Wicked Wonderland\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xdhLAADGSse8KCrsDLBuM5b68Cg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qlfqDJ9Piv5ufzYA8j2319mwKZU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Now that the Queen of Hearts is nice and Cinderella is safe, things seem perfect for Red and Chloe… But little do they know that changing the past created a new villain — Maddox Hatter. When Maddox captures the Queen of Hearts, Red and Chloe must work alongside Red’s new sister Pink, Luisa Madrigal’s son Luis, and Maddox’s son Max to save her and Wonderland.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420817,\"title\":\"Aladdin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ykUEbfpkf8d0w49pHh0AD2KrT52.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rVqY0Bo4Npf6EIONUROxjYAJfmD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A kindhearted street urchin named Aladdin embarks on a magical adventure after finding a lamp that releases a wisecracking genie while a power-hungry Grand Vizier vies for the same lamp that has the power to make their deepest wishes come true.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4523,\"title\":\"Enchanted\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn't operate on a \\\"happily ever after\\\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4688,\"title\":\"Across the Universe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/447c8Te3DXC46rQvDEixKGO4dS6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s2mJnlqvRwVo1XpnmuPGvWso7pJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When young dockworker Jude leaves Liverpool to find his estranged father in the United States, he is swept up by the waves of change that are re-shaping the nation. Jude falls in love with Lucy, who joins the growing anti-war movement. As the body count in Vietnam rises, political tensions at home spiral out of control and the star-crossed lovers find themselves in a psychedelic world gone mad.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"IwJRteaJLTI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"rtVOC8xyNic\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"VN5zup3b7fw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}